(9552, 547, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"da21979\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"container_type\":\"grid\",\"grid_columns_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"2\"},\"grid_rows_grid\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"},\"grid_rows_grid_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"fr\",\"size\":\"1\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7dd0547\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h2 style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-size: 60px; line-height: 1.2; color: #1d1d1f; font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal;\\\">Nh\\u1eadn Thanh To\\u00e1n D\\u1ec5 D\\u00e0ng.<span class=\\\"text-red d-block\\\" style=\\\"color: #cf232a; display: block !important;\\\">M\\u1ecdi L\\u00fac, M\\u1ecdi N\\u01a1i.<\\/span><\\/h2><p class=\\\"hero-description\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 28px; font-size: 20px; color: rgba(54, 55, 57, 0.7); font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 32px !important;\\\">Ch\\u1ea5p nh\\u1eadn thanh to\\u00e1n kh\\u00f4ng ti\\u1ebfp x\\u00fac ch\\u1ec9 b\\u1eb1ng smartphone, ho\\u1eb7c l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn t\\u1eeb d\\u1ea3i s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m m\\u00e1y POS di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00f4ng minh c\\u1ee7a ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"},{\"id\":\"b53a77e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"$$type\":\"image\",\"value\":{\"src\":{\"$$type\":\"image-src\",\"value\":{\"id\":{\"$$type\":\"image-attachment-id\",\"value\":702},\"url\":null}}}},\"link\":{\"$$type\":\"link\",\"value\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"e-image\",\"styles\":[],\"interactions\":[],\"editor_settings\":[],\"version\":\"0.0\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"109d46a\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":100},\"_flex_size\":\"none\",\"_element_width\":\"initial\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"width_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vw\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"width_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vw\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]},\"min_height_mobile\":{\"unit\":\"vh\",\"size\":\"\",\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"4a32136\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"carousel_name\":\"Image Carousel\",\"carousel\":[{\"id\":704,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/BTL\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/One-UI-9-beta-cover-1-2.jpg\"},{\"id\":705,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/BTL\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/OPPO-Find-X9s-Find-X9-ultra.jpg\"},{\"id\":706,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/BTL\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/Realme-16T-ngay-ra-mat-1-1.jpg\"},{\"id\":707,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/BTL\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/thong-tin-oppo-find-x10-series-cover-2.jpg\"},{\"id\":708,\"url\":\"http:\\/\\/localhost\\/BTL\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2026\\/05\\/xiaomi-ultrathin-magnetic-10000-mah-ra-mat-thumb-2.jpg\"}],\"thumbnail_size\":\"full\",\"slides_to_show\":\"1\",\"arrows_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":43,\"sizes\":[]},\"dots_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":4,\"sizes\":[]},\"dots_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":10,\"sizes\":[]},\"_padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":true},\"_element_width\":\"inherit\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image-carousel\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"4be0500\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"99dba2d\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<h3 class=\\\"section-title\\\" style=\\\"margin: 0px 0px 8px; line-height: 1.2; text-align: center; font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal; background-color: #f8f8f8; font-size: 40px !important; color: #363739 !important;\\\"><span class=\\\"text-red\\\" style=\\\"color: #cf232a;\\\">Gi\\u1ea3i Ph\\u00e1p Thanh To\\u00e1n<\\/span><br \\/>Cho M\\u1ecdi Nhu C\\u1ea7u<\\/h3>\\n<p class=\\\"section-description\\\" style=\\\"line-height: 23px; font-size: 16px; color: rgba(54, 55, 57, 0.7); text-align: center; font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; background-color: #f8f8f8; margin: 0px !important;\\\">T\\u1eeb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, nh\\u1ecf g\\u1ecdn \\u0111\\u1ebfn c\\u00e1c gi\\u1ea3i ph\\u00e1p m\\u00e1y POS to\\u00e0n di\\u1ec7n. Ch\\u00fang t\\u00f4i<br \\/>c\\u00f3 m\\u1ecdi th\\u1ee9 b\\u1ea1n c\\u1ea7n \\u0111\\u1ec3 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"074b108\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":[],\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"61d1c26\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"widgetType\":\"nested-accordion\",\"settings\":{\"items\":[{\"item_title\":\"Xem th\\u00eam\",\"_id\":\"e6d9577\"}]},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8173860\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"_title\":\"item #1\",\"content_width\":\"full\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"3e7ce55\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">T\\u1eeb nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u1ed3ng k\\u1ec1nh, ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng nghe g\\u1ecdi \\u0111\\u1ebfn nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc smartphone hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i t\\u00edch h\\u1ee3p h\\u00e0ng lo\\u1ea1t t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng ti\\u1ec7n \\u00edch, h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111\\u00e3 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i c\\u00e1ch con ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1ed1ng v\\u00e0 k\\u1ebft n\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi nhau. B\\u00e0i vi\\u1ebft n\\u00e0y s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u01b0a b\\u1ea1n \\u0111i qua h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh l\\u1ecbch s\\u1eed \\u0111\\u00e1ng kinh ng\\u1ea1c c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, \\u0111\\u1ed3ng th\\u1eddi kh\\u00e1m ph\\u00e1 c\\u00e1c lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh hi\\u1ec7n c\\u00f3 tr\\u00ean th\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u00e0 c\\u00e1c l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p nh\\u1ea5t t\\u1eeb Viettel Store.<\\/span><\\/p><h2 style=\\\"font-size: 30px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">H\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh<\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><a aria-label=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link rank-math-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/dien-thoai\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i<\\/a> \\u0111\\u00e3 c\\u00f3 m\\u1ed9t h\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n d\\u00e0i h\\u01a1n m\\u1ed9t th\\u1ebf k\\u1ef7, b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1eeb ph\\u00e1t minh c\\u1ee7a Alexander Graham Bell v\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 1876. Ban \\u0111\\u1ea7u, \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ch\\u1ec9 c\\u00f3 ch\\u1ee9c n\\u0103ng \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n l\\u00e0 truy\\u1ec1n gi\\u1ecdng n\\u00f3i t\\u1eeb n\\u01a1i n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u1ebfn n\\u01a1i kh\\u00e1c, nh\\u01b0ng \\u0111\\u00e3 m\\u1edf ra cu\\u1ed9c c\\u00e1ch m\\u1ea1ng vi\\u1ec5n th\\u00f4ng. V\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ti\\u1ebfn b\\u1ed9 c\\u1ee7a c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7, c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 nghi\\u00ean c\\u1ee9u kh\\u00f4ng ng\\u1eebng t\\u00ecm c\\u00e1ch gi\\u1ea3m k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc v\\u00e0 c\\u1ea3i thi\\u1ec7n kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"H\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224348\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>H\\u00e0nh tr\\u00ecnh ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh&nbsp;<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">T\\u1eeb nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh \\u0111\\u1ebfn \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u00e0o nh\\u1eefng n\\u0103m 1940 v\\u00e0 1950, cu\\u1ed9c \\u0111ua ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u00e3 b\\u1eaft \\u0111\\u1ea7u khi c\\u00e1c nh\\u00e0 khoa h\\u1ecdc tr\\u00ean kh\\u1eafp th\\u1ebf gi\\u1edbi t\\u00ecm c\\u00e1ch mang thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng ra kh\\u1ecfi kh\\u00f4ng gian c\\u1ed1 \\u0111\\u1ecbnh. \\u0110\\u1ebfn cu\\u1ed1i nh\\u1eefng n\\u0103m 1970, c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean \\u0111\\u00e3 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n. \\u0110\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t, v\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 1973, Martin Cooper, k\\u1ef9 s\\u01b0 c\\u1ee7a Motorola, \\u0111\\u00e3 th\\u1ef1c hi\\u1ec7n cu\\u1ed9c g\\u1ecdi \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean b\\u1eb1ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng, m\\u1edf \\u0111\\u1ea7u cho k\\u1ef7 nguy\\u00ean m\\u1edbi.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-2.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110\\u1ebfn cu\\u1ed1i nh\\u1eefng n\\u0103m 1970, c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean \\u0111\\u00e3 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224349\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-2.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-2-300x187.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110\\u1ebfn cu\\u1ed1i nh\\u1eefng n\\u0103m 1970, c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean \\u0111\\u00e3 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Th\\u1eadp k\\u1ef7 1990 \\u2013 B\\u01b0\\u1edbc chuy\\u1ec3n m\\u00ecnh th\\u00e0nh smartphone<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Th\\u1eadp k\\u1ef7 1990 ch\\u1ee9ng ki\\u1ebfn s\\u1ef1 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00f4ng minh v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng c\\u1ea3i ti\\u1ebfn \\u0111\\u00e1ng k\\u1ec3 v\\u1ec1 t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng. Motorola StarTAC ra m\\u1eaft v\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 1996 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c coi l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean, mang l\\u1ea1i tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m m\\u1edbi m\\u1ebb v\\u1edbi k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc nh\\u1ecf g\\u1ecdn v\\u00e0 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng m\\u1edf r\\u1ed9ng t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng.&nbsp;<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-3.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Th\\u1eadp k\\u1ef7 1990 ch\\u1ee9ng ki\\u1ebfn s\\u1ef1 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00f4ng minh\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224350\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-3.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-3-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Th\\u1eadp k\\u1ef7 1990 ch\\u1ee9ng ki\\u1ebfn s\\u1ef1 xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n c\\u1ee7a c\\u00e1c thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng th\\u00f4ng minh<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">K\\u1ec3 t\\u1eeb \\u0111\\u00f3, c\\u00e1c h\\u1ec7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u h\\u00e0nh nh\\u01b0 Symbian, BlackBerry OS, iOS v\\u00e0 Android xu\\u1ea5t hi\\u1ec7n, m\\u1edf \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1eddng cho c\\u00e1c h\\u00e3ng c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 l\\u1edbn nh\\u01b0 Apple, Samsung, HTC v\\u00e0 Google ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n c\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh.<\\/p><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Nh\\u1eefng c\\u1ea3i ti\\u1ebfn trong th\\u1eadp k\\u1ef7 2000 v\\u00e0 s\\u1ef1 ra \\u0111\\u1eddi c\\u1ee7a iPhone<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 2007, Apple ra m\\u1eaft iPhone th\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean, m\\u1ed9t b\\u01b0\\u1edbc \\u0111\\u1ed9t ph\\u00e1 thay \\u0111\\u1ed5i ho\\u00e0n to\\u00e0n di\\u1ec7n m\\u1ea1o c\\u1ee7a \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng. <a aria-label=\\\"iPhone (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link rank-math-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/dtdd-apple-iphone\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">iPhone<\\/a> gi\\u1edbi thi\\u1ec7u giao di\\u1ec7n c\\u1ea3m \\u1ee9ng m\\u01b0\\u1ee3t m\\u00e0, h\\u1ec7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u h\\u00e0nh iOS th\\u00e2n thi\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng truy c\\u1eadp \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng phong ph\\u00fa, m\\u1edf \\u0111\\u1ea7u cho cu\\u1ed9c \\u0111ua smartphone ng\\u00e0y c\\u00e0ng kh\\u1ed1c li\\u1ec7t. Sau \\u0111\\u00f3, nhi\\u1ec1u th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u kh\\u00e1c nh\\u01b0 <a aria-label=\\\"\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Samsung (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link rank-math-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/dtdd-samsung\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Samsung<\\/a>, <a aria-label=\\\"\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i OPPO (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link rank-math-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/dtdd-oppo\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i OPPO<\\/a> v\\u00e0 <a aria-label=\\\"\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Xiaomi (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link rank-math-link\\\" href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/dtdd-xiaomi\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Xiaomi<\\/a>,\\u2026 c\\u0169ng nhanh ch\\u00f3ng gia nh\\u1eadp th\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-4.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"V\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 2007, Apple ra m\\u1eaft iPhone th\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224351\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-4.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-4-300x186.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>V\\u00e0o n\\u0103m 2007, Apple ra m\\u1eaft iPhone th\\u1ebf h\\u1ec7 \\u0111\\u1ea7u ti\\u00ean<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h2 style=\\\"font-size: 30px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Smartphone \\u2013 V\\u1eadt \\u201cb\\u1ea5t ly th\\u00e2n\\u201d trong th\\u1eddi \\u0111\\u1ea1i s\\u1ed1<\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Ng\\u00e0y nay, smartphone kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u01a1n thu\\u1ea7n l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 giao ti\\u1ebfp m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n mang l\\u1ea1i nhi\\u1ec1u l\\u1ee3i \\u00edch v\\u01b0\\u1ee3t xa k\\u1ef3 v\\u1ecdng:<\\/p><ul style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-top: 0px; margin-bottom: 10px; justify-content: space-between; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><li style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">K\\u1ebft n\\u1ed1i v\\u00e0 giao ti\\u1ebfp d\\u1ec5 d\\u00e0ng<\\/span>: V\\u1edbi smartphone, b\\u1ea1n c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 g\\u1ecdi video, g\\u1eedi tin nh\\u1eafn, email, v\\u00e0 c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt m\\u1ea1ng x\\u00e3 h\\u1ed9i b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 l\\u00fac n\\u00e0o v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea5t k\\u1ef3 n\\u01a1i \\u0111\\u00e2u.<\\/li><li style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">C\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd<\\/span>: \\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c trang b\\u1ecb nhi\\u1ec1u \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng c\\u00f4ng s\\u1edf gi\\u00fap b\\u1ea1n qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c, l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c t\\u1eeb xa, v\\u00e0 x\\u1eed l\\u00fd t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u hi\\u1ec7u qu\\u1ea3.<\\/li><li style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Trung t\\u00e2m gi\\u1ea3i tr\\u00ed di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng<\\/span>: Smartphone c\\u00f3 th\\u1ec3 xem phim, nghe nh\\u1ea1c, ch\\u01a1i game, v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea3nh ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao, tr\\u1edf th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t trung t\\u00e2m gi\\u1ea3i tr\\u00ed c\\u00e1 nh\\u00e2n.<\\/li><li style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">S\\u1ee9c kh\\u1ecfe v\\u00e0 theo d\\u00f5i th\\u1ec3 ch\\u1ea5t<\\/span>: C\\u00e1c t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng \\u0111o l\\u01b0\\u1eddng b\\u01b0\\u1edbc ch\\u00e2n, nh\\u1ecbp tim v\\u00e0 theo d\\u00f5i gi\\u1ea5c ng\\u1ee7 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 b\\u1ea1n duy tr\\u00ec l\\u1ed1i s\\u1ed1ng l\\u00e0nh m\\u1ea1nh.<\\/li><li style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">C\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 h\\u1ecdc t\\u1eadp v\\u00e0 tra c\\u1ee9u th\\u00f4ng tin<\\/span>: Smartphone h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 truy c\\u1eadp h\\u00e0ng lo\\u1ea1t ngu\\u1ed3n t\\u00e0i li\\u1ec7u, kh\\u00f3a h\\u1ecdc tr\\u1ef1c tuy\\u1ebfn, gi\\u00fap n\\u00e2ng cao ki\\u1ebfn th\\u1ee9c m\\u1ecdi l\\u00fac m\\u1ecdi n\\u01a1i.<\\/li><\\/ul><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-5-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Smartphone kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u01a1n thu\\u1ea7n l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 giao ti\\u1ebfp m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n mang l\\u1ea1i nhi\\u1ec1u l\\u1ee3i \\u00edch kh\\u00e1c\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224353\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-5-1.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-5-1-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Smartphone kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 \\u0111\\u01a1n thu\\u1ea7n l\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng c\\u1ee5 giao ti\\u1ebfp m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n mang l\\u1ea1i nhi\\u1ec1u l\\u1ee3i \\u00edch kh\\u00e1c<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h2 style=\\\"font-size: 30px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">B\\u1ea3ng th\\u00f4ng s\\u1ed1 k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt smartphone hi\\u1ec7n h\\u00e0nh&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/h2><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Khi mua \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh, c\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng s\\u1ed1 k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt sau \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed quan tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nhu c\\u1ea7u s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a b\\u1ea1n:<\\/p><figure class=\\\"wp-block-table\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><table style=\\\"border-collapse: collapse; border: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238); margin: 1em 0px 30px; width: fit-content; background-color: transparent; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; word-break: break-word; line-height: normal; color: rgb(123, 123, 123);\\\"><tbody><tr style=\\\"border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(238, 238, 238);\\\"><td style=\\\"padding: 8px 20px; border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219) rgb(238, 238, 238); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px 1px; border-image: none 100% \\/ 1 \\/ 0 stretch; font-size: 0.85em;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Th\\u00f4ng s\\u1ed1 k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt<\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"padding: 8px 20px; border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219) rgb(238, 238, 238); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px 1px; border-image: none 100% \\/ 1 \\/ 0 stretch; font-size: 0.85em;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u00dd ngh\\u0129a<\\/span><\\/td><td style=\\\"padding: 8px 20px; border-color: rgb(209, 213, 219) rgb(238, 238, 238); border-style: solid; border-width: 0px 1px 1px; border-image: none 100% \\/ 1 \\/ 0 stretch; font