 thu\\u1eadt sau \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed quan tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224354\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-6.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-6-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>C\\u00e1c th\\u00f4ng s\\u1ed1 k\\u1ef9 thu\\u1eadt sau \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 ti\\u00eau ch\\u00ed quan tr\\u1ecdng \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h2 style=\\\"font-size: 30px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng c\\u00f3 m\\u1ea5y lo\\u1ea1i?<\\/span><\\/h2><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Ph\\u00e2n lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i theo nhu c\\u1ea7u<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ph\\u00e2n lo\\u1ea1i d\\u1ef1a tr\\u00ean nhu c\\u1ea7u s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng. M\\u1ed7i lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i s\\u1ebd \\u0111\\u00e1p \\u1ee9ng c\\u00e1c y\\u00eau c\\u1ea7u kh\\u00e1c nhau c\\u1ee7a ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng t\\u00f9y thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0o m\\u1ee5c \\u0111\\u00edch s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng. D\\u01b0\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u00e2y l\\u00e0 m\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 lo\\u1ea1i \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn:<\\/p><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea3nh<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 b\\u00f9ng n\\u1ed5 c\\u1ee7a m\\u1ea1ng x\\u00e3 h\\u1ed9i, nhu c\\u1ea7u chia s\\u1ebb h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh v\\u00e0 video ng\\u00e0y c\\u00e0ng cao. Nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi y\\u00eau th\\u00edch ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea3nh th\\u01b0\\u1eddng l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u00f3 camera ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao, trang b\\u1ecb nhi\\u1ec1u t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng nh\\u01b0 ch\\u1ee5p g\\u00f3c r\\u1ed9ng, zoom quang h\\u1ecdc v\\u00e0 kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng x\\u1eed l\\u00fd h\\u00ecnh \\u1ea3nh xu\\u1ea5t s\\u1eafc. M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u1eabu n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt bao g\\u1ed3m iPhone 16 Pro, Samsung Galaxy S24 Ultra, OPPO Find N3,\\u2026<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-7.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u00f3 camera ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224355\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-7.png 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-7-300x157.png 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u00f3 camera ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho doanh nh\\u00e2n<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Nh\\u1eefng ai th\\u01b0\\u1eddng xuy\\u00ean s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u1ec3 l\\u00e0m vi\\u1ec7c s\\u1ebd c\\u1ea7n m\\u1ed9t chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u00f3 t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng \\u0111\\u1ed3ng b\\u1ed9 h\\u00f3a d\\u1eef li\\u1ec7u, \\u1ee9ng d\\u1ee5ng qu\\u1ea3n l\\u00fd th\\u1eddi gian v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt t\\u1ed1t. M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p cho c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c nh\\u01b0 iPhone 16 Pro Max, Samsung Galaxy Z Fold6 v\\u00e0 Xiaomi 14 Ultra,\\u2026<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-8.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho doanh nh\\u00e2n\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224356\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-8.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-8-300x198.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho doanh nh\\u00e2n<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i d\\u00e0nh cho game th\\u1ee7<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u1edbi s\\u1ef1 ph\\u00e1t tri\\u1ec3n m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd c\\u1ee7a ng\\u00e0nh c\\u00f4ng nghi\\u1ec7p game, nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf chuy\\u00ean bi\\u1ec7t cho game th\\u1ee7 tr\\u1edf n\\u00ean ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn. Nh\\u1eefng thi\\u1ebft b\\u1ecb n\\u00e0y th\\u01b0\\u1eddng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c trang b\\u1ecb c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd, m\\u00e0n h\\u00ecnh c\\u00f3 t\\u1ed1c \\u0111\\u1ed9 l\\u00e0m m\\u1edbi cao, \\u0111\\u1ea3m b\\u1ea3o tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m ch\\u01a1i game m\\u01b0\\u1ee3t m\\u00e0. M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u1eabu \\u0111\\u00e1ng ch\\u00fa \\u00fd l\\u00e0 Asus ROG Phone 7 v\\u00e0 Xiaomi 14 series, Samsung Galaxy S24 series,\\u2026<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-9.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf chuy\\u00ean bi\\u1ec7t cho game th\\u1ee7\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224357\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-9.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-9-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf chuy\\u00ean bi\\u1ec7t cho game th\\u1ee7<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u1eddi trang<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Nhu c\\u1ea7u v\\u1ec1 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf \\u0111\\u1eb9p, hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i c\\u0169ng ng\\u00e0y c\\u00e0ng t\\u0103ng. C\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 ph\\u1ea3i c\\u00f3 hi\\u1ec7u su\\u1ea5t t\\u1ed1t m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n ph\\u1ea3i mang t\\u00ednh th\\u1ea9m m\\u1ef9 cao. C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Samsung Galaxy Z Flip v\\u00e0 OPPO Reno series \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c nhi\\u1ec1u ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi y\\u00eau th\\u00edch.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-10.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Samsung Galaxy Z Flip\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224358\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-10.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-10-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Samsung Galaxy Z Flip<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho h\\u1ecdc sinh, sinh vi\\u00ean<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u1edbi nhu c\\u1ea7u li\\u00ean l\\u1ea1c v\\u00e0 t\\u00ecm ki\\u1ebfm th\\u00f4ng tin, h\\u1ecdc sinh v\\u00e0 sinh vi\\u00ean c\\u1ea7n nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i gi\\u00e1 c\\u1ea3 ph\\u1ea3i ch\\u0103ng, pin l\\u00e2u v\\u00e0 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tr\\u1ebb trung. M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u1eabu nh\\u01b0 Samsung Galaxy A15 v\\u00e0 Xiaomi Redmi Note 13 r\\u1ea5t ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng n\\u00e0y.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-11.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho h\\u1ecdc sinh, sinh vi\\u00ean\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224359\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-11.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-11-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cho h\\u1ecdc sinh, sinh vi\\u00ean<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i c\\u01a1 b\\u1ea3n<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi ch\\u1ec9 c\\u1ea7n g\\u1ecdi \\u0111i\\u1ec7n v\\u00e0 nh\\u1eafn tin, \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ph\\u1ed5 th\\u00f4ng l\\u00e0 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn l\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng. Nh\\u1eefng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m n\\u00e0y \\u0111\\u01a1n gi\\u1ea3n, d\\u1ec5 s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng v\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u00f3 gi\\u00e1 th\\u00e0nh th\\u1ea5p, nh\\u01b0 Nokia 5710 v\\u00e0 Masstel Hapi 30, Sumo G2 4G,\\u2026.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-12.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ph\\u1ed5 th\\u00f4ng Nokia 5710 l\\u00e0 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn l\\u00fd t\\u01b0\\u1edfng\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224360\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-12.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-12-300x201.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ph\\u1ed5 th\\u00f4ng Nokia 5710 l\\u00e0 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn l\\