3u l\\u00e0 Galaxy A06 v\\u00e0 Xiaomi Redmi A2 Plus, Vivo Y02A,\\u2026.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-13.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Galaxy A04\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224361\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-13.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-13-300x200.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Galaxy A04<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i t\\u1ea7m trung (4-7 tri\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ed3ng)<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac n\\u00e0y mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn s\\u1ef1 c\\u00e2n b\\u1eb1ng gi\\u1eefa gi\\u00e1 th\\u00e0nh v\\u00e0 hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng. Nh\\u1eefng chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i trong kho\\u1ea3ng gi\\u00e1 n\\u00e0y th\\u01b0\\u1eddng s\\u1edf h\\u1eefu c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh t\\u1ed1t h\\u01a1n, m\\u00e0n h\\u00ecnh ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao v\\u00e0 camera c\\u1ea3i ti\\u1ebfn. C\\u00e1c m\\u1eabu n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt bao g\\u1ed3m Samsung Galaxy A55 v\\u00e0 OPPO A58.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure c