t=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-15.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-15-300x181.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Samsung Galaxy A55<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h4 style=\\\"font-size: 18px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 10px 0px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cao c\\u1ea5p nh\\u1ea5t (tr\\u00ean 13 tri\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u1ed3ng)<\\/span><\\/h4><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">\\u0110\\u1ed1i v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi s\\u1eb5n s\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u01b0 cho m\\u1ed9t chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i h\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u, c\\u00e1c s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac n\\u00e0y th\\u01b0\\u1eddng c\\u00f3 thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf sang tr\\u1ecdng, camera chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p v\\u00e0 hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd. M\\u1ed9t s\\u1ed1 m\\u1eabu ti\\u00eau bi\\u1ec3u nh\\u01b0 iPhone 16 Pro Max v\\u00e0 Samsung Galaxy Fold6.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-16.png\\\" alt=\\\"iPhone 16 Pro Max\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224364\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-16.png 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-16-300x200.png 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>iPhone 16 Pro Max<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h2 style=\\\"font-size: 30px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">C\\u00e1c h\\u00e3ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i b\\u00e1n ch\\u1ea1y t\\u1ea1i Viettel Store<\\/span><\\/h2><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Apple<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/apple\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" aria-label=\\\"Apple (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">Apple<\\/a> lu\\u00f4n l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u00e1nh gi\\u00e1 cao trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cao c\\u1ea5p, v\\u1edbi d\\u00f2ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m iPhone n\\u1ed5i ti\\u1ebfng. iPhone s\\u1edf h\\u1eefu h\\u1ec7 sinh th\\u00e1i iOS m\\u01b0\\u1ee3t m\\u00e0 v\\u00e0 t\\u1ed1i \\u01b0u, mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m \\u0111\\u1ed3ng b\\u1ed9 tuy\\u1ec7t \\u0111\\u1ed1i t\\u1eeb ph\\u1ea7n c\\u1ee9ng \\u0111\\u1ebfn ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m.&nbsp;<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-17.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Apple lu\\u00f4n l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u00e1nh gi\\u00e1 cao trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cao c\\u1ea5p\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224365\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-17.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-17-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Apple lu\\u00f4n l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c \\u0111\\u00e1nh gi\\u00e1 cao trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i cao c\\u1ea5p<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Th\\u00eam v\\u00e0o \\u0111\\u00f3, t\\u00ednh b\\u1ea3o m\\u1eadt c\\u1ee7a iPhone \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng tin t\\u01b0\\u1edfng, c\\u00f9ng d\\u1ecbch v\\u1ee5 h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 to\\u00e0n di\\u1ec7n t\\u1eeb Apple Care v\\u00e0 nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u1eeda h\\u00e0ng \\u1ee7y quy\\u1ec1n gi\\u00fap ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng Vi\\u1ec7t Nam d\\u1ec5 d\\u00e0ng ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn v\\u00e0 s\\u1eeda ch\\u1eefa. B\\u00ean c\\u1ea1nh \\u0111\\u00f3, thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tinh t\\u1ebf, c\\u1eadp nh\\u1eadt h\\u1ec7 \\u0111i\\u1ec1u h\\u00e0nh \\u0111\\u1ec1u \\u0111\\u1eb7n, v\\u00e0 camera ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng cao c\\u0169ng l\\u00e0 nh\\u1eefng y\\u1ebfu t\\u1ed1 gi\\u00fap iPhone gi\\u1eef v\\u1eefng v\\u1ecb th\\u1ebf d\\u1eabn \\u0111\\u1ea7u trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac n\\u00e0y.<\\/p><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Samsung<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><a href=\\\"https:\\/\\/viettelstore.vn\\/samsung\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" aria-label=\\\"Samsung (opens in a new tab)\\\" rel=\\\"noreferrer noopener\\\" class=\\\"rank-math-link\\\" style=\\\"text-decoration: none; color: rgb(233, 28, 39);\\\">Samsung<\\/a> l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng t\\u1eeb t\\u1ea7m trung \\u0111\\u1ebfn cao c\\u1ea5p. \\u0110\\u1eb7c bi\\u1ec7t, d\\u00f2ng Galaxy S v\\u00e0 Galaxy Note lu\\u00f4n mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m Android cao c\\u1ea5p v\\u1edbi m\\u00e0n h\\u00ecnh Super AMOLED s\\u1eafc n\\u00e9t, \\u0111\\u1ed9 t\\u01b0\\u01a1ng ph\\u1ea3n cao v\\u00e0 b\\u00fat S Pen \\u0111\\u1ed9c quy\\u1ec1n cho d\\u00f2ng Note, \\u0111\\u00e1p \\u1ee9ng t\\u1ed1t c\\u00e1c t\\u00e1c v\\u1ee5 c\\u00f4ng vi\\u1ec7c v\\u00e0 s\\u00e1ng t\\u1ea1o.&nbsp;<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-18.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Samsung l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng \\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224366\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-18.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-18-300x200.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>Samsung l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi c\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i th\\u00f4ng minh \\u0111a d\\u1ea1ng&nbsp;<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">V\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u d\\u00f2ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m kh\\u00e1c nh\\u01b0 Galaxy A v\\u00e0 Galaxy M, Samsung c\\u0169ng ti\\u1ebfp c\\u1eadn ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng c\\u00f3 ng\\u00e2n s\\u00e1ch th\\u1ea5p h\\u01a1n, mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn phong ph\\u00fa v\\u00e0 ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u nhu c\\u1ea7u s\\u1eed d\\u1ee5ng kh\\u00e1c nhau.<\\/p><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Xiaomi<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Xiaomi nhanh ch\\u00f3ng v\\u01b0\\u01a1n l\\u00ean th\\u00e0nh m\\u1ed9t trong nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ean tu\\u1ed5i h\\u00e0ng \\u0111\\u1ea7u t\\u1ea1i th\\u1ecb tr\\u01b0\\u1eddng Vi\\u1ec7t Nam nh\\u1edd v\\u00e0o chi\\u1ebfn l\\u01b0\\u1ee3c gi\\u00e1 c\\u1ea1nh tranh v\\u00e0 ch\\u1ea5t l\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng s\\u1ea3n ph\\u1ea9m \\u1ed5n \\u0111\\u1ecbnh. C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng Mi v\\u00e0 Redmi c\\u1ee7a Xiaomi t\\u1eadp trung v\\u00e0o hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng, v\\u1edbi c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd v\\u00e0 pin b\\u1ec1n, ph\\u00f9 h\\u1ee3p v\\u1edbi nh\\u1eefng ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng c\\u1ea7n hi\\u1ec7u su\\u1ea5t cao trong t\\u1ea7m<span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\"> gi\\u00e1 \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i<\\/span> ph\\u1ea3i ch\\u0103ng. Xiaomi c\\u0169ng ti\\u00ean phong t\\u00edch h\\u1ee3p nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 s\\u1ea1c nhanh v\\u00e0 camera \\u0111\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e2n gi\\u1ea3i cao v\\u00e0o ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac t\\u1ea7m trung, mang \\u0111\\u1ebfn cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng s\\u1ef1 l\\u1ef1a ch\\u1ecdn gi\\u00e1 tr\\u1ecb t\\u1ed1t nh\\u1ea5t.<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-19.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Xiaomi t\\u1eadp trung v\\u00e0o hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng, v\\u1edbi c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd v\\u00e0 pin b\\u1ec1n\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224367\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-19.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-19-300x169.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>\\u0110i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i Xiaomi t\\u1eadp trung v\\u00e0o hi\\u1ec7u n\\u0103ng, v\\u1edbi c\\u1ea5u h\\u00ecnh m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd v\\u00e0 pin b\\u1ec1n<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><h3 style=\\\"font-size: 24px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 500; margin: 20px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); line-height: 1.1; font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-weight: 700;\\\">Oppo<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">Oppo l\\u00e0 th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i ph\\u1ed5 bi\\u1ebfn t\\u1ea1i Vi\\u1ec7t Nam, \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c bi\\u1ebft \\u0111\\u1ebfn v\\u1edbi kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea3nh ch\\u00e2n th\\u1ef1c v\\u00e0 c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 l\\u00e0m \\u0111\\u1eb9p \\u0111\\u1ed9c quy\\u1ec1n, ph\\u1ee5c v\\u1ee5 cho nh\\u1eefng ai y\\u00eau th\\u00edch nhi\\u1ebfp \\u1ea3nh di \\u0111\\u1ed9ng. C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Oppo Reno v\\u00e0 Find X kh\\u00f4ng ch\\u1ec9 n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tr\\u1ebb trung, hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i, m\\u00e0 c\\u00f2n s\\u1edf h\\u1eefu camera \\u0111\\u1ed9 ph\\u00e2n gi\\u1ea3i cao, c\\u00f4ng ngh\\u1ec7 AI l\\u00e0m \\u0111\\u1eb9p v\\u00e0 ph\\u1ea7n m\\u1ec1m \\u1ed5n \\u0111\\u1ecbnh.&nbsp;<\\/p><div class=\\\"wp-block-image\\\" style=\\\"margin-bottom: 1em; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\"><figure class=\\\"aligncenter size-large\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 16px; margin: 0px auto;\\\"><img src=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-20.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Oppo Reno n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tr\\u1ebb trung, hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i\\\" class=\\\"wp-image-224368\\\" srcset=\\\"https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-20.jpg 600w, https:\\/\\/news.vio.vn\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2024\\/11\\/dien-thoai-20-300x188.jpg 300w\\\" sizes=\\\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\\\" style=\\\"border-width: 0px;\\\"><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px;\\\"><\\/p><figcaption style=\\\"margin: 3px 0px 1em; font-size: 11px; color: rgb(160, 160, 160);\\\"><em>C\\u00e1c d\\u00f2ng \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i nh\\u01b0 Oppo Reno n\\u1ed5i b\\u1eadt v\\u1edbi thi\\u1ebft k\\u1ebf tr\\u1ebb trung, hi\\u1ec7n \\u0111\\u1ea1i<\\/em><\\/figcaption><\\/figure><\\/div><p style=\\\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin: 0px 0px 10px; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: SFProDisplayRegular;\\\">B\\u00ean c\\u1ea1nh \\u0111\\u00f3, Oppo c\\u00f2n c\\u00f3 nhi\\u1ec1u ch\\u01b0\\u01a1ng tr\\u00ecnh h\\u1ed7 tr\\u1ee3 v\\u00e0 \\u01b0u \\u0111\\u00e3i h\\u1ea5p d\\u1eabn cho ng\\u01b0\\u1eddi d\\u00f9ng, khi\\u1ebfn th\\u01b0\\u01a1ng hi\\u1ec7u n\\u00e0y c\\u00e0ng tr\\u1edf n\\u00ean quen thu\\u1ed9c v\\u00e0 \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c y\\u00eau th\\u00edch trong ph\\u00e2n kh\\u00fac t\\u1ea7m trung v\\u00e0 cao c\\u1ea5p.<\\/p>\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true,\"isLocked\":true}]},{\"id\":\"112e49e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":false}]');
