\\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i m\\u1ea1nh m\\u1ebd v\\u1edbi nhi\\u1ec1u c\\u1ea3i ti\\u1ebfn c\\u1ee7a nh\\u00e0 Samsung trong n\\u0103m nay.\\u00a0<\\/p><p style=\\\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; border-style: solid; margin: 12px 0px; color: #212b36; font-family: __Inter_84faf7, __Inter_Fallback_84faf7; font-size: 15.4px; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; text-align: justify;\\\">C\\u1ea3 ba m\\u1eabu \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i \\u0111\\u1ec1u c\\u00f3 th\\u00eam nh\\u1eefng t\\u00ednh n\\u0103ng m\\u1edbi \\u0111\\u1ec3 tr\\u1ea3i nghi\\u1ec7m khi d\\u00f9ng \\u0111\\u01b0\\u1ee3c n\\u00e2ng cao h\\u01a1n. Samsung S25 Ultra h\\u1ee9a h\\u1eb9n l\\u00e0 chi\\u1ebfc \\u0111i\\u1ec7n tho\\u1ea1i s\\u1edf h\\u1eefu kh\\u1ea3 n\\u0103ng quay ch\\u1ee5p \\u1ea5n t\\u01b0\\u1ee3ng gi\\u00fap t\\u1ea1o n\\u00ean nh\\u1eefng b\\u1ee9c h\\u00ecnh v\\u00e0 video chuy\\u00ean nghi\\u1ec7p. Samsung Galaxy S25 c\\u00f3 k\\u00edch th\\u01b0\\u1edbc m\\u00e0n h\\u00ecnh nh\\u1ecf nh\\u1ea5t l\\u00e0 6.2 inch, Samsung Galaxy S25 Plus l\\u00e0 6.7 inch v\\u00e0 b\\u1ea3n S25 Ultra l\\u00e0 6.9 inch.<\\/p><div class=\\\"image-sforum\\\" style=\\\"--tw-border-spacing-x: 0; --tw-border-spacing-y: 0; --tw-translate-x: 0; --tw-translate-y: 0; --tw-rotate: 0; --tw-skew-x: 0; --tw-skew-y: 0; --tw-scale-x: 1; --tw-scale-y: 1; --tw-scroll-snap-strictness: proximity; --tw-ring-offset-width: 0px; --tw-ring-offset-color: #fff; --tw-ring-color: rgba(59,130,246,.5); --tw-ring-offset-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-ring-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow: 0 0 #0000; --tw-shadow-colored: 0 0 #0000; border: 0