(701, 1, '2026-05-14 14:16:28', '2026-05-14 14:16:28', 'Giải Pháp Thanh Toán Số 1\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0px 0px 16px; font-size: 60px; line-height: 1.2; color: #1d1d1f; font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal;\">Nhận Thanh Toán Dễ Dàng.Mọi Lúc, Mọi Nơi.</h2>\n<p style=\"line-height: 28px; font-size: 20px; color: rgba(54, 55, 57, 0.7); font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 32px !important;\">Chấp nhận thanh toán không tiếp xúc chỉ bằng smartphone, hoặc lựa chọn từ dải sản phẩm máy POS di động thông minh của chúng tôi.</p>\n \n<p style=\"line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(54, 55, 57, 0.7); font-family: \'Be Vietnam Pro\'; font-style: normal; font-weight: 400; margin-bottom: 0px !important;\">Được tin dùng bởi hơn +500.000 doanh nghiệp và chủ shop</p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 23px; font-size: 14px; color: rgba(54, 55, 57, 0.7); margin-bottom: 0px !important;\"> </p>\n<img style=\"max-height: 100%; height: 655px; object-fit: cover; z-index: 0; position: relative;\" src=\"https://mpos.vn/assets/landingV2/Landing-mPos-V2/mpos-assets/img/banner-primary.png\" alt=\"\" />					\n								<figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/One-UI-9-beta-cover-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"One-UI-9-beta-cover (1)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/Xperia-1-VIII-ra-mat-3-1.jpg\" alt=\"Xperia-1-VIII-ra-mat-3\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/googlebook-ra-mat-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"googlebook-ra-mat-1\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/thong-tin-honor-pad-20-1-1-1.jpg\" alt=\"thong-tin-honor-pad-20-1 (1)\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/xiaomi-ultrathin-magnetic-10000-mah-ra-mat-thumb-1.jpg\" alt=\"xiaomi-ultrathin-magnetic-10000-mah-ra-mat-thumb\" /></figure><figure><img src=\"http://localhost/BTL/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/thong-tin-o